 that implies the printed one. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.lem-seam-upper-or-middle"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.lem-seam-upper-or-middle"],"id":"long.lem-seam-upper-or-middle","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Lemma 6.41 (Seam upper-or-middle classification)","locator":"Long record Lemma 6.41, p. 55, label lem:seam-upper-or-middle","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*At a row $s\\ge5$, the terminal rank is omitted in the next row, $s\\notin D_{s+1}$, if and only if either\n$$\n4o_s+p_s^+\\le2^{s+1},\n$$\nor this inequality fails and\n$$\n4\\,\\mathrm{rem}(s)+2^{s+1}-p_s^-<2^{s+2}+4.\n$$\nThese are exactly branches $\\mathrm U$ and $\\mathrm M$ of Theorem 5.16. On either branch the new terminal weight does not fit; on $\\mathrm R$ it does. This is an exact classification, not a conjecture inferred from observed branch labels.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.lem-seam-upper-or-middle","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/long.lem-seam-upper-or-middle","id":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.lem-seam-upper-or-middle%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.seamGreedy_terminal_false_iff_upperOrMiddle%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/edges/%5B%22long.lem-seam-upper-or-middle%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.seamGreedy_terminal_false_iff_upperOrMiddle%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.seamGreedy_terminal_false_iff_upperOrMiddle"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:5d6514073ac52d75d011c84ff900912363a94ff7fe2e141210e6bf3c445c0cc1/nodes/